OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 28 DEC
OL,4,G1300FDawn O'Porter
OL,5,     GAuthor and broadcaster Dawn
OL,6,     GO'Porter joins the Classic FM
OL,7,     Gfamily. Join her for three hours
OL,8,     Gof the best classical music, to
OL,9,     Gfind a moment of calm in the days
OL,10,     Gafter Christmas.
OL,11,G1600FA Classical Book Club
OL,12,     GMariella Frostrup presents a
OL,13,     Gspecial three-part series
OL,14,     Gexploring the huge range of
OL,15,     Gclassical music inspired by
OL,16,     Gliterature. Expect music from
OL,17,     GHarry Potter to Romeo and Juliet.
OL,18,G1900FRelaxing Evenings
OL,19,     GZeb Soanes eases you into the
OL,20,     Gevening with a relaxing
OL,21,     Gsoundtrack of all-time favourites
OL,22,     Gand contemporary classics.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
